; Speedup benchmark: hand-written OCaml against the CUDA backend on the
; same two workloads, at f32 or f64. Not a test -- it asserts nothing about
; speed, it only checks the two paths agree and prints the numbers, plus one
; machine-readable RESULT line for scripts/bench-record.sh.
(executable
 (name bench)
 (public_name cudacaml-bench)
 (libraries cudacaml cudacaml_examples unix))
